:: But if I'm dead, how do I stand here before you? {"position":"1200,800","size":"100,100"}
Shall I tell you a bit about yourself?

[[Myself?]]


:: Mission? {"position":"1200,400","size":"100,100"}
Ah, yes. You were created to conquer the tower we're in. This is your birthplace, and it will most likely be the place you die in for all eternity.



[[Tower?]]


:: Myself? {"position":"1200,600","size":"100,100"}
Yes, you. You, the creation that dies, but only in body. Whenever you die, the tower forms you down here again. And again, and again, and again we have this same conversation.


[[Start]]


:: Piss off! {"position":"1000,1100","size":"100,100"}
This again. Might I remind you that you yourself, however far back it was, hired me to guide you whenever you die?


[[What? How long ago, and how often did I die?]]


:: Start {"position":"800,800","size":"100,100"}
Greetings. It seems you've died yet again. Ah, what am I saying? You can never remember.

[[Who are you?]]
[[Piss off!]]
[[What do you mean by died again?]]
[[Leave]]


:: Leave [item:health_potion organs:10] {"position":"800,1000","size":"100,100"}
Off you go, then. I'll be here when you return. You always do. And take this as always.



:: Tower? {"position":"1100,200","size":"100,100"}
Where else did you think you were? The tower, of course! That is not for me to tell you, though.

[[Start]]


:: What do you mean by died again? {"position":"1000,800","size":"100,100"}
You're down here, so you must have died. And since you don't remember me, you must have died.

[[But if I'm dead, how do I stand here before you?]]


:: What? How long ago, and how often did I die? {"position":"1200,1100","size":"100,100"}
It was fun counting your deaths at first, but so much time has passed that I can't remember how often you've died. How long ago is another thing I can't remember. Nor do I want to. So much time has passed since I forgot that it would only sadden me.

[[Why are you still alive, then?]]


:: Who are you? {"position":"1000,525","size":"100,100"}
Ah, this, time and time again. I'm called The Keeper. Whenever you die and inevitably forget, I'm there to tell you about yourself and the mission you have to accomplish.

[[Mission?]]
[[Myself?]]


:: Why are you still alive, then? {"position":"1400,1100","size":"100,100"}
I'm only alive because you, in the past, let me consume a bit of your flesh. With it, I've retained a fraction of your strange immortality.

[[Start]]
